# GeoCommerce - E-Commerce Location & Delivery System

A complete OpenStreetMap + Leaflet location engine for e-commerce with:
1. Customer Delivery Address Picker (with Nominatim geocoding & draggable marker)
2. Shop & Warehouse Directory (with admin CRUD and coordinate storage)
3. Real-Time Courier Delivery Tracking (with moving courier marker & route polyline)
4. Progressive Web App (PWA) with offline support and home screen installation
5. Android Studio / Jetpack Compose / Osmdroid code templates

## Running Locally:
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```
Visit http://localhost:3000 to launch the application.

## Building Android APK:
Using Capacitor:
```bash
npm install @capacitor/core @capacitor/cli @capacitor/android
npx cap init GeoCommerce com.geocommerce.app --web-dir dist
npm run build
npx cap add android
npx cap open android
```
Then click **Build > Build Bundle(s) / APK(s) > Build APK(s)** in Android Studio!